      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Came here to suggest this! Before mods were banned I used to use one to make my camera bigger so I could get a better view of small details in my photos. As it is now I have to turn on stream mode and open up an overlay to look at my desktop, It's not a very smooth workflow.",
