      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was able to get a similar result by using OVR Toolkit and setting it to display the VRC window while the stream camera is enabled.\n\nGetting an ingame (and free) option to do this would be great though, especially for accessibility or for those running VRC at low resolutions.",
